  "description": "About: Registration closes on 9th October 2026 at 11:59 PM (midnight). Make sure to register before the deadline to confirm your participation. Registration fees are 800 for the Hackathon and 500 for the Idiathon. Teams must submit their PPT/Idea by 12-Oct-26 to qualify (If your team doesn't qualify, Fees amount will be refunded to your original payment method.) Shortlisted PPTs(Teams) will be declared by 13-Oct-26. Teams travelling long distance(other states) are encouraged to send in their ppt's early. PPT should clearly mention: Problem Statement chosen, Solution Approach, Technology Stack, and Team Details. Shortlisted teams will be invited for the 24-hour Hackathon on 16th–17th October 2026 at BIT Campus, Bamni, Ballarpur. Shortlisted teams will be invited for Ideathon Presentation on 17th October 2026 at BIT Campus, Bamni, Ballarpur. If any team requires assitance from our end , please feel free to contact us. For queries, contact: Aniket Bahuriya : 8530007967 Sanjokta : 8788471834 S.S. Goje : 9834602964 Piyush Gupta : 9607349454",
